    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41125" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-nūdo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to uncover</i>, <i>make naked; to bare</i>, <i>strip</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bracchia umero tenus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 8, p. 214, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puellam laciniis cunctis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2</span></i>
			, p. 122, 9; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">8, p. 215, 37: tectum, parietes, januas,</span>”
				<i>to uncover</i>, <i>open</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 2 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coronam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 1, 15</span></i>
			. </div>
